/* Syntax-2 dual WORD16 MAS across X/Y MOD0/MOD1/MOD2 addressing. Each row
 * fixes one mode combination; R/S/D/XAR/YAR ride the word and MOD3
 * neighborhoods stay undecoded. T loads the X-side word in the
 * read phase; (src) minus the product lands in src or dst. */
