/* Syntax-2 dual WORD16 MACSU across X/Y MOD0/MOD1/MOD2 addressing. Each row
 * fixes one mode combination; S/XAR/YAR ride the word and MOD3
 * neighborhoods stay undecoded. T loads the X-side word in the
 * read phase; (src) plus unsigned-(X) times signed-(Y) lands in
 * the S-selected accumulator with no rounding. */
